"Adds warmth on top of Night Shift, from none to deep red, all day. At night, “Warmer at night” adds a little more." = "叠加在夜览之上的暖色，从无到深红，整天有效。夜里，“夜间更暖”再加一点。";
"Automatic: on at night and off by day, as set under Night schedule in General. On and Off hold until you change them." = "自动：夜里开、白天关，按“通用”中“夜间时段”的设置。“开”和“关”会一直保持到你更改。";
"Warmer at night: off" = "夜间更暖：关";
"Red at night: now" = "夜间变红：现在";
"Red at night" = "夜间变红";
"Warmer at night: +%ld now" = "夜间更暖：现在 +%ld";
"Warmer at night: +%ld" = "夜间更暖：+%ld";
"Auto" = "自动";
"Peeking on several displays" = "在多台显示器上一瞥";
"Peeking on one display" = "在一台显示器上一瞥";
"Automatic" = "自动";
"Warmer at night" = "夜间更暖";
"Night · %ld s" = "夜间 · %ld 秒";
"Shows the night look for a minute, long enough to switch to other apps and see it there. Click again to end it sooner." = "显示一分钟的夜间效果，足够你切换到其他应用里看看。再点按一次可提前结束。";
"Try the night look" = "试试夜间效果";
"Displays Settings…" = "显示器设置…";
"Opens Displays in System Settings. Night Shift… at the bottom shows the same schedule and its color temperature." = "打开系统设置中的“显示器”。最下面的“夜览…”显示同一个时间表和色温。";
"Open Displays settings" = "打开显示器设置";
"Night schedule" = "夜间时段";
"Sunset to sunrise" = "日落到日出";
"Custom hours" = "自定义时段";
"When the night is, for Night Shift on Automatic and for “Warmer at night”." = "什么时候算夜晚：用于“自动”的夜览和“夜间更暖”。";
"Location Services…" = "定位服务…";
"Opens Privacy & Security → Location Services. Turn them on; under System Services (Details… at the bottom), Setting time zone should be allowed too." = "打开“隐私与安全”→“定位服务”。请打开它；在“系统服务”（最下面的“详细信息…”）里，“设定时区”也需要允许。";
"Open Location Services settings" = "打开定位服务设置";
"Date & Time…" = "日期与时间…";
"Opens General → Date & Time. Turn on Set time zone automatically using your current location; macOS then asks for Location Services if they are off." = "打开“通用”→“日期与时间”。请打开“使用你的当前位置自动设定时区”；如果定位服务关着，macOS 会询问。";
"Open Date & Time settings" = "打开日期与时间设置";
"When the night starts." = "夜晚何时开始。";
"Night starts" = "夜晚开始";
"When the night ends." = "夜晚何时结束。";
"Night ends" = "夜晚结束";
"From" = "从";
"to" = "到";
"Your warmth for the whole day, on top of Night Shift, from Off to Red." = "你一整天的暖色，叠加在夜览之上，从“关”到“红”。";
"This app is a gift from the universe to you. It has been fully funded by life.\n\nMy future projects and my work are still growing. Support comes in many forms: a contribution, a word to someone Less Pull might help, feedback that makes the app better, or whatever suits you. Thanks for being part of life and making it more beautiful for everyone.\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose" = "这个应用是宇宙送给你的礼物，生命已经为它付清了全部。\n\n我接下来的项目和我的工作还在生长。支持有很多种方式：一份心意，对可能用得上 Less Pull 的人说一句话，让应用变得更好的反馈，或者任何适合你的方式。谢谢你成为生命的一部分，让它对每个人都更美好。\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose";
"Shows every way to support my work." = "显示支持我工作的所有方式。";
"Remind me later" = "以后提醒我";
"Hide this for now. It comes back later, each time after a longer while." = "暂时隐藏。以后还会出现，每次间隔更久。";
"I’ve already given back" = "我已经回馈过了";
"Hide this card for good, with thanks." = "永久隐藏这张卡片，带着感谢。";
"Another year of Less Pull with you" = "和你一起的又一年 Less Pull";
"Thank you for being part of it. If you feel like giving again, the door is open; if not, enjoy the quiet.\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose" = "谢谢你参与其中。如果你又想付出，门一直开着；如果不想，就享受这份安静吧。\n\n— Jiri Arion Rose";
"Thank you 🧡" = "谢谢 🧡";
"Giving and regiving, Walter Russell called it: the rhythm all of life moves in. Thank you for being part of it, and for giving back." = "给予，再给予，沃尔特·拉塞尔这样称呼它：一切生命运行其中的节奏。谢谢你成为其中的一部分，也谢谢你的回馈。";
"You have arrived somewhere quieter.\n\nLess Pull takes the color out of your screen, so it pulls at you less. Think of noise cancelling, for your eyes: nothing is gone, everything still works. It just stops shouting." = "你来到了一个更安静的地方。\n\nLess Pull 把屏幕上的颜色拿走，让它不再那么拉扯你。就像给眼睛用的降噪：什么都没少，一切照常运作。它只是不再大喊大叫。";
"This is your icon, right above this window. Keep it far right, next to the clock: there macOS never hides it. Can’t see it? Show the hidden menu-bar icons, then hold ⌘ and drag it there." = "这是你的图标，就在这个窗口正上方。把它放在最右边、时钟旁：在那里 macOS 从不隐藏它。看不到？先显示菜单栏中隐藏的图标，再按住 ⌘ 把它拖到那里。";
"The » shows the hidden icons; holding the Command key, the pointer drags the circle out toward the clock, and the other icons make room" = "» 显示隐藏的图标；按住 Command 键，指针把圆圈拖向时钟，其他图标让出位置";
"A short tour on your own screen, with a browser connection if you like." = "在你自己的屏幕上进行的简短导览，愿意的话还可以连接浏览器。";
"Setup only" = "仅设置";
"Skips the tour and goes straight to connecting a browser for website exceptions." = "跳过导览，直接为网站的单独设置连接浏览器。";
"First, move your icon next to the clock" = "先把图标移到时钟旁";
"Less Pull lives in that circle. When an app with many menus is in front, macOS hides the menu-bar icons that are furthest from the clock, and the circle with them. Hold ⌘ and drag it all the way right, next to the clock (can’t see it? show the hidden menu-bar icons first): there it always stays visible. The tour starts as soon as it’s there." = "Less Pull 住在那个圆圈里。当一个菜单很多的应用在前台时，macOS 会隐藏离时钟最远的菜单栏图标，圆圈也会一起被藏起来。按住 ⌘ 把它拖到最右边、时钟旁（看不到？先显示隐藏的图标）：在那里它会一直可见。它一到那里，导览就开始。";
"Start when it’s there" = "到了就开始";
"Start anyway" = "仍然开始";
"First, bring out your icon" = "先把图标找出来";
"The tour starts at the Less Pull circle in the menu bar, and right now it’s hidden. Show the hidden menu-bar icons, then hold ⌘ and drag the circle all the way right, next to the clock: there macOS never hides it. The tour begins as soon as it’s there." = "导览从菜单栏中的 Less Pull 圆圈开始，而它现在被隐藏了。先显示菜单栏中隐藏的图标，再按住 ⌘ 把圆圈拖到最右边、时钟旁：在那里 macOS 从不隐藏它。它一到那里，导览就开始。";
"Drag it next to the clock…" = "拖到时钟旁…";
"Night schedule: %@ to %@" = "夜间时段：%@ 到 %@";
"Night schedule: Sunset to sunrise" = "夜间时段：日落到日出";
"Warmer at night: Red" = "夜间更暖：红";
"Peek shortcut: %@" = "一瞥快捷键：%@";
"Peek shortcut: none" = "一瞥快捷键：无";
"Extra Warmth %ld%%" = "暖色 %ld%%";
"Exception for %@" = "%@ 的单独设置";
"Less Pull paused" = "Less Pull 已暂停";
"Less Pull running" = "Less Pull 运行中";
"A session is running" = "专注进行中";
"Peek kept on" = "一瞥保持中";
"Less Pull, out on the tour" = "Less Pull，导览途中";
"Scan with your phone." = "用手机扫一扫。";
"Copied" = "已拷贝";
"Ways to support my work" = "支持我工作的方式";
"Whichever is easiest for you. Every way reaches me directly, and every one is welcome." = "哪种对你最方便就用哪种。每一种都直接到我这里，每一种都欢迎。";
"Card or Apple Pay, once or monthly. The easiest for most people." = "银行卡或 Apple Pay，一次或每月。对大多数人最方便。";
"QR code" = "二维码";
"Open" = "打开";
"With a PayPal account." = "使用 PayPal 账户。";
"A transfer from almost any currency, with low fees." = "从几乎任何货币转账，手续费低。";
"One address, Native SegWit. Please send Bitcoin only." = "一个地址，Native SegWit。请只发送比特币。";
"Copy" = "拷贝";
"Send feedback" = "发送反馈";
"Without money" = "不花钱的方式";
"A word to someone Less Pull might help, or feedback that makes it better." = "对可能用得上 Less Pull 的人说一句话，或给出让它更好的反馈。";
"Night Shift is Automatic, On or Off. Automatic is on at night and off by day, as set under Night schedule in General: Sunset to sunrise, or Custom hours. “Warmer at night” follows the same night and adds a few points to your Extra Warmth, even with Night Shift off. At the lock screen and screensaver, where Less Pull’s warmth cannot reach, Night Shift takes over at full warmth while Less Pull is quieting your screen." = "夜览设为“自动”“开”或“关”。“自动”夜里开、白天关，按“通用”中“夜间时段”的设置：“日落到日出”或“自定义时段”。“夜间更暖”跟随同一个夜晚，即使夜览关着，也会在你的暖色上加几点。在锁定屏幕和屏幕保护程序上，Less Pull 的暖色到不了；Less Pull 正在让屏幕安静时，由夜览接替，调到最暖。";
"Less Pull %@ (%@)\n\n%@\n%@\nDisplays: %lu, each with its own matrix\nDisplay events: %lu; recoveries: %lu\nGrayscale setting: %@; grayscale showing now: %@; exception active: %@%@\n\n“Warmer at night” follows the night hours shown under General; it does not prove the display looks warmer." = "Less Pull %@ (%@)\n\n%@\n%@\n显示器：%lu 台，各有自己的矩阵\n显示器事件：%lu；恢复：%lu\n灰度设置：%@；当前显示灰度：%@；单独设置生效：%@%@\n\n“夜间更暖”跟随“通用”中显示的夜间时段；这并不证明显示器看起来更暖。";
"Today about %@ to %@, worked out for your time zone." = "今天大约 %@ 到 %@，按你的时区算出。";
"Every day from %@ to %@." = "每天 %@ 到 %@。";
" Night Shift on Automatic and “Warmer at night” both follow it." = "“自动”的夜览和“夜间更暖”都跟随它。";
"\n\nmacOS keeps sunset to sunrise only when it may use your location for the time zone. Turn on Set time zone automatically under General → Date & Time; macOS then asks for Location Services if they are off. Until then Less Pull works it out from your time zone and switches Night Shift itself." = "\n\n只有在可以用你的位置来定时区时，macOS 才会保持“日落到日出”。请在“通用”→“日期与时间”中打开“自动设定时区”；如果定位服务关着，macOS 会询问。在那之前，Less Pull 按你的时区算出时间，并自己切换夜览。";
" Right now it is on." = "现在它是开着的。";
" Right now it is off." = "现在它是关着的。";
"On, day and night, until you change it." = "日夜都开着，直到你更改。";
"Off, day and night. “Warmer at night” still warms the night without it." = "日夜都关着。“夜间更暖”照样让夜晚更暖。";
"On at night and off by day, as set under Night schedule below." = "夜里开、白天关，按下面“夜间时段”的设置。";
"Extra Warmth · red at night" = "暖色 · 夜间变红";
"Extra Warmth · +%ld at night" = "暖色 · 夜间 +%ld";
"At night, Less Pull adds this much warmth on top of yours. Night Shift itself can stay off." = "到了夜里，Less Pull 会在你的暖色上再加这么多。夜览本身可以一直关着。";
