"Slow" = "慢";
"Normal" = "正常";
"Fast" = "快";
"How much time each line gets." = "每句话停留多久。";
"Tour speed" = "导览速度";
"One line back. The ← key works too while I talk." = "退回一句。我说话时，← 键也可以。";
"One line on. The → key works too while I talk; while I wait for you, it does the step or skips it." = "前进一句。我说话时，→ 键也可以；我在等你时，它会替你完成这一步或跳过它。";
"One line back" = "退回一句";
"One line on" = "前进一句";
"End tour" = "结束导览";
"Less Pull tour" = "Less Pull 导览";
"Go to %ld · %@" = "前往第 %ld 站 · %@";
"Stop %ld of %ld · %@" = "第 %ld 站，共 %ld 站 · %@";
"Help: Sunset to sunrise" = "帮助：日落到日出";
"Help: %@" = "帮助：%@";
"Knock knock." = "咚咚。";
"Copy path" = "拷贝路径";
"Copied ✓" = "已拷贝 ✓";
"Paused" = "已暂停";
"Paused. Click me again, or press →, to go on." = "已暂停。再点按我一下，或按 →，就继续。";
"That’s the start of this stop. The numbers on the bar go further back." = "这一站从这里开始。更早的内容，点按栏上的数字。";
"Once more, then." = "那就再来一次。";
"Everything back as it was." = "一切都恢复原样了。";
"Opera opens the store page. Click Add to Opera, then confirm. I’ll notice." = "Opera 会打开商店页面。点按“添加到 Opera”，然后确认。我会注意到的。";
"Slower again? No rush; I’m on holiday." = "还要更慢？不急，我在度假。";
"Slower it is. Real pixels are heavier; I felt that." = "那就慢一点。真实的像素更重，我感觉到了。";
"Faster, then. I’ll try not to blur." = "那就快一点。我尽量不变模糊。";
"Normal speed again." = "恢复正常速度。";
"A colleague! Real pointer, real job. I’m just visiting." = "同行！真正的指针，真正的工作。我只是来做客的。";
"Hello again. Two pointers, one screen. Historic." = "又见面了。两个指针，一块屏幕。历史性的一刻。";
"Yes?" = "嗯？";
"Eager! I like that. One moment; I’m getting there." = "真心急！我喜欢。稍等，马上到。";
"Full screen. Big of you. The menu bar is hiding; the pointer at the top edge brings it back." = "全屏。真大方。菜单栏藏起来了；把指针移到屏幕最上方，它就回来。";
"You opened the menu. Look around; I’ll catch up." = "你打开了菜单。随便看看；我随后就到。";
"There it is! Thank you. A door I can see: luxury." = "找到了！谢谢。一扇看得见的门：真奢侈。";
"That was %@. My dot is on %@: click the circle again." = "那是“%@”。我的圆点在“%@”上：请再点按一次圆圈。";
"The menu closed. Click the circle again, then %@." = "菜单关上了。再点按一次圆圈，然后选“%@”。";
"Three minutes. I’m fine; I have all day." = "三分钟了。没关系，我有一整天。";
"Take your time. I’m not going anywhere; I only just got here." = "慢慢来。我哪儿也不去；我才刚到。";
"Or skip it: → on the bar. We go on without it." = "或者跳过：点按栏上的 →。我们不做这一步，继续。";
"The circle, up in the menu bar. One click opens the menu." = "就是菜单栏上的那个圆圈。点按一下就会打开菜单。";
"Click the circle, then Settings… at the bottom of the menu. My dot marks it." = "点按圆圈，然后选菜单最下面的“设置…”。我的圆点会标出来。";
"The %@ tab, at the top of the window." = "窗口顶部的“%@”标签页。";
"Up top, the row of tabs: %@." = "最上面那排标签页：%@。";
"I’ll wait up by the bar, out of your way. Guest rules." = "我在栏旁边等你，不挡路。做客的规矩。";
"Or skip it: →. The setup waits behind my door: Less Pull’s Settings → Websites." = "或者跳过：→。设置在我的门后等着：Less Pull 设置 → 网站。";
"No rush. The page is in %@; I’m out here, admiring the real pixels." = "不急。页面在 %@ 里；我在外面欣赏真实的像素。";
"A small companion app opens. Click its button: Open Safari Settings." = "一个小小的配套应用会打开。点按它的按钮：“打开 Safari 浏览器设置”。";
"Safari didn’t open? Open it yourself: Safari, Settings, Extensions." = "Safari 浏览器没有打开？那就自己打开：Safari 浏览器、设置、扩展。";
"In Extensions, turn on Less Pull and allow it on all websites. I’ll notice." = "在“扩展”里打开 Less Pull，并允许它用于所有网站。我会注意到的。";
"%@ opens the store page. Click Add to Chrome, then Add extension. I’ll notice." = "%@ 会打开商店页面。点按“添加至 Chrome”，再点按“添加扩展程序”。我会注意到的。";
"%@ opens the store page. Click its Add button, then Add extension. I’ll notice." = "%@ 会打开商店页面。点按它的添加按钮，再点按“添加扩展程序”。我会注意到的。";
"Edge asks once about extensions from other stores. Say yes to that first." = "Edge 会询问一次是否允许其他商店的扩展。先在那里同意。";
"Still loading? Or does Opera say “Download error: Installation is not enabled”? Then there’s another way." = "还在载入？还是 Opera 提示“下载错误：安装未启用”？那还有另一条路。";
"Show me the other way" = "给我看另一条路";
"Still trying" = "还在试";
"Skip" = "跳过";
"Take your time. I’ll notice when it’s in." = "慢慢来。装好了我会知道。";
"%@ is connected. With a website in front, the menu now offers its exception." = "%@ 已连接。网站在前台时，菜单现在会提供它的单独设置。";
"%@ is connected. That was the hard part; the rest is one slider." = "%@ 已连接。最难的部分过去了；剩下的就是一个滑块。";
"Let’s leave it for now. Set up… tries again whenever you like." = "先放一放吧。“设置…”随时可以再试。";
"Let’s leave it. The setup waits in Less Pull’s own Settings, the Websites tab. On we go." = "先放一放吧。设置在 Less Pull 自己的设置里等着，“网站”标签页。我们继续。";
"First, Opera’s extensions page. Copy its address here, then in Opera: ⌘L, ⌘V, Return." = "先打开 Opera 的扩展页面。在这里拷贝它的地址，然后在 Opera 中：⌘L、⌘V、Return。";
"Copy opera://extensions" = "拷贝 opera://extensions";
"The page is open" = "页面已打开";
"Top right of that page: Developer mode. Switch it on." = "那个页面的右上角：开发者模式。把它打开。";
"It’s on" = "已打开";
"Now drag the folder from the little window onto Opera’s extensions page. I’ll notice." = "现在把小窗口里的文件夹拖到 Opera 的扩展页面上。我会注意到的。";
"Drag it onto Opera’s extensions page." = "把它拖到 Opera 的扩展页面上。";
"Hold the folder, drop it anywhere on the extensions page. It loads by itself." = "按住文件夹，在扩展页面上的任何地方松开。它会自己载入。";
"Sunset works here already. Nothing to do; the seasons take it from here." = "这里的日落已经生效了。什么都不用做；之后交给季节吧。";
"Sunset to sunrise needs your location: macOS sets the time zone from it. Shall I show you the switches?" = "“日落到日出”需要你的位置：macOS 据此设定时区。要我带你看看那些开关吗？";
"Yes, show me" = "好，带我看";
"Click Date & Time…, the small button there. System Settings opens at the spot." = "点按那里的小按钮“日期与时间…”。系统设置会直接打开到那个位置。";
"The small button under Night schedule: Date & Time…" = "“夜间时段”下面的小按钮：“日期与时间…”";
"Or leave it: →. Less Pull works it out from your time zone meanwhile." = "或者先不管：→。在此期间，Less Pull 按你的时区来算。";
"In Date & Time, turn on “Set time zone automatically using your current location”." = "在“日期与时间”中，打开“使用你的当前位置自动设定时区”。";
"The switch is in Date & Time, next to the time zone. I’ll wait right here." = "开关在“日期与时间”里，时区旁边。我在这里等。";
"Now Location Services, in Privacy & Security: turn it on at the top. It may ask for your password." = "现在是“隐私与安全”里的“定位服务”：在最上面把它打开。可能会要你的密码。";
"System Settings, Privacy & Security, Location Services: the switch at the top." = "系统设置、隐私与安全、定位服务：最上面的开关。";
"Last one: at the bottom, System Services, Details…. Turn on Setting time zone." = "最后一步：最下面的“系统服务”，“详细信息…”。打开“设定时区”。";
"Still in Location Services: scroll down to System Services, then Details…." = "还在“定位服务”里：往下滚动到“系统服务”，然后点“详细信息…”。";
"Leave it for now. Less Pull works it out from your time zone until then." = "先放着吧。在那之前，Less Pull 按你的时区来算。";
"Sunset’s in. Less Pull noticed by itself; I just stood here looking useful." = "日落生效了。Less Pull 自己注意到了；我只是站在这儿，装作很有用。";
"Reduce Motion is on. Understood: no hopping, no spinning. I’ll walk." = "“减弱动态效果”已打开。明白：不跳，不转。我走着去。";
"The menu bar has a notch. I keep wanting to look under it." = "菜单栏有个刘海。我总想往底下看。";
"Done. I’ll be in my circle if you need me." = "好了。需要我的话，我就在我的圆圈里。";
"I’ll walk you through %@. It takes a minute." = "我来带你完成 %@。一分钟就好。";
"Hi! I’m the cursor from lesspull.com. Normally I live there. Today: a trip." = "你好！我是 lesspull.com 上的光标。平时住在那儿。今天：出门旅行。";
"Hi! I’m the cursor from the Less Pull website. I live there. Today: a trip." = "你好！我是 Less Pull 网站上的光标。我住在那儿。今天：出门旅行。";
"So this is your Mac. It looks great, by the way." = "原来这就是你的 Mac。顺便说一句，真好看。";
"Second visit! I’m touched. Same jokes, though; I only packed the one set." = "第二次来访！我很感动。不过笑话还是那些；我只带了一套。";
"That little bar is the tour: seven stops. Click a number to jump there." = "那个小栏就是导览：七站。点按数字就能跳过去。";
"← and → go one line back or on: here, or on your keyboard. Handy if I’m too quick." = "← 和 → 退回或前进一句：在这里，或者用你的键盘。我说太快时很方便。";
"End tour sends me home at once." = "“结束导览”会让我马上回家。";
"One promise: this is a playing field. At the end, you pick what stays; the rest goes back." = "先说好一件事：这是一片游乐场。到最后，由你决定留下什么；其余的都会恢复原样。";
"Paused already? Handy. We start from the pull anyway." = "已经暂停了？正好。反正我们从吸引力开始。";
"First, the pull. Less Pull pauses for a moment: your screen without it." = "先来看吸引力。Less Pull 暂停一会儿：这是没有它的你的屏幕。";
"Full color. Everything on it wants a look. That’s the pull; I feel it too." = "满满的颜色。上面的一切都想被看一眼。这就是吸引力；我也感觉到了。";
"Hm. My door is behind the notch. Of all the places." = "嗯。我的门在刘海后面。偏偏在那儿。";
"Hm. My door is hidden. Your menu bar is full." = "嗯。我的门被藏起来了。你的菜单栏满了。";
"Show the hidden icons up there, then hold ⌘ and drag my circle toward the clock. Like this." = "先在上面显示隐藏的图标，再按住 ⌘ 把我的圆圈拖向时钟。像这样。";
"Let’s carry on. You can come back to this; the tour is under About." = "我们继续吧。你可以以后再回来；导览在“关于”里。";
"I’d drag it myself, but guest rules: I don’t touch anything here." = "我很想自己拖，但做客的规矩：这里的东西我一样都不碰。";
"Room: quit an app whose icon you don’t need, or ⌘-drag a system icon out of the bar." = "腾出位置：退出一个你用不着其图标的应用，或者按住 ⌘ 把一个系统图标拖出菜单栏。";
"Or leave it for now: → on the bar. I’ll manage without my door." = "或者先这样：点按栏上的 →。没有门我也能应付。";
"That circle is Less Pull. Also my door: I came in through it." = "那个圆圈就是 Less Pull。也是我的门：我就是从那里进来的。";
"Tip: hold ⌘ and drag me next to the clock. There macOS never hides me." = "小提示：按住 ⌘ 把我拖到时钟旁。在那里 macOS 从不隐藏我。";
"It’s up there somewhere, hiding. Anyway: that circle is Less Pull, and my door." = "它就躲在上面某个地方。总之：那个圆圈就是 Less Pull，也是我的门。";
"Your turn: click the circle. The menu drops out of it." = "轮到你了：点按圆圈。菜单会从里面落下来。";
"The amber dot is mine: it marks what to pick. Here: Resume Less Pull." = "那个琥珀色圆点是我的：它标出要选的项目。这里是：继续 Less Pull。";
"There it goes. The color steps back, and the pull with it." = "看，颜色退开了，吸引力也跟着退开。";
"There it goes. The screen warms up, and the pull eases." = "看，屏幕变暖了，吸引力也松开了。";
"Nothing is gone. It just pulls at you less." = "什么都没少。只是它不那么拉扯你了。";
"Again, please: click the circle. In the menu, Extra Warmth has a slider." = "请再来一次：点按圆圈。菜单里的“暖色”有一个滑块。";
"Drag it toward Red. I’ll go with it; watch my tag." = "把它往“红”那边拖。我跟着走；看我的名牌。";
"Other way: toward Red, to the right. Either works, though." = "反方向：往“红”，向右。不过两边都行。";
"The slider, next to Extra Warmth. Drag it, any direction." = "就是“暖色”旁边的滑块。拖动它，哪个方向都行。";
"Red. Everything’s a sunset, me included. Now slide it back to where it feels right." = "红。一切都成了晚霞，我也是。现在把它拖回到你觉得舒服的地方。";
"To the left, until it feels right. The slider is in the menu, under the circle." = "往左，直到你觉得舒服。滑块在菜单里，圆圈下面。";
"There. That warmth is yours." = "好了。这份暖色是你的。";
"All the way to Off. Fine too; Red is at the far right." = "一直到“关”。这样也行；“红”在最右边。";
"A touch of amber. Far right is Red; far left is Off. Your call." = "一点琥珀色。最右边是“红”，最左边是“关”。你来定。";
"I’ll ask Less Pull to resume, then. Quietly." = "那我就请 Less Pull 继续吧。轻轻地。";
"Everything else lives in this menu too: pausing, Night Shift, Settings…" = "其他的也都住在这个菜单里：暂停、夜览、设置…";
"Some apps need their color. Photos, say. An exception lets one app keep it." = "有些应用需要它的颜色。比如“照片”。单独设置可以让一个应用保留颜色。";
"Bring that app to the front, then click the circle. The menu offers it." = "把那个应用放到前台，然后点按圆圈。菜单里就会有它。";
"My dot is on Exception for %@… Choose it." = "我的圆点在“%@ 的单独设置…”上。选它。";
"The real panel, for %@. Change one thing; the rest carries over." = "这是真正的面板，属于 %@。改一样东西；其余的都沿用。";
"Find Grayscale and click Off. That’s color, for this app only." = "找到“灰度”，点按“关”。这就是彩色，只对这个应用。";
"The Grayscale row, inside the panel: three choices. Click Off." = "面板里的“灰度”那一行：三个选项。点按“关”。";
"That works too. Anything in here is only for %@." = "这样也行。这里的一切都只对 %@ 有效。";
"There. %@ in color, for as long as it’s in front." = "好了。%@ 在前台时就是彩色的。";
"Now click another app, or the desktop: it goes quiet again." = "现在点按另一个应用或桌面：又安静下来了。";
"Any other app will do. Or click the desktop." = "随便哪个别的应用都行。或者点按桌面。";
"Quiet again. The exception stays with %@, waiting. Like me, but with a purpose." = "又安静了。单独设置留在 %@ 那里等着。和我一样，只不过它有目的。";
"%@ is already connected. Good: websites get exceptions too." = "%@ 已经连接好了。很好：网站也能有单独设置。";
"Exceptions for websites need %@ connected: a small extension. Connect it now? Optional." = "网站的单独设置需要连接 %@：一个小小的扩展。现在连接吗？可选。";
"Exceptions for websites need your browser connected: a small extension. Connect it now? Optional." = "网站的单独设置需要连接你的浏览器：一个小小的扩展。现在连接吗？可选。";
"Connect" = "连接";
"Which ones? One or several; each gets the same small extension." = "哪些？一个或多个；每个都装同一个小扩展。";
"That’s enough for now. More browsers: Less Pull’s Settings → Websites. I’ll come and help." = "先这样就够了。更多浏览器：Less Pull 设置 → 网站。我会来帮忙。";
"Open any website in %@ and bring it to the front." = "在 %@ 中打开任意一个网站，并把它放到前台。";
"Any page at all; the first tab you have is fine." = "哪个页面都行；你现有的第一个标签页就可以。";
"Another time, then. With a website in front, the menu offers it." = "那就下次吧。网站在前台时，菜单会提供它。";
"Click the circle. The menu has a new line now." = "点按圆圈。菜单里现在多了一行。";
"My dot: Exception for %@… Choose it." = "我的圆点：“%@ 的单独设置…”。选它。";
"Same panel, for a website. Whole domain, or This exact page: your call." = "同一个面板，用于网站。“整个域名”或“仅此页面”：你来定。";
"Give it some Extra Warmth: drag the slider. Only this site gets it." = "给它一点暖色：拖动滑块。只有这个网站会变暖。";
"The Extra Warmth slider, inside the panel. Drag it a little." = "面板里的“暖色”滑块。稍微拖一下。";
"Warmer, just for %@. Every other site stays as it was." = "更暖了，只对 %@。其他网站都保持原样。";
"Only the address goes to Less Pull, never the page. Private tabs: not even that." = "Less Pull 只收到地址，从不收到页面。无痕标签页：连地址都不收。";
"No problem. Websites wait in Less Pull’s own Settings, the Websites tab, whenever you like." = "没问题。网站随时在 Less Pull 自己的设置里等你，“网站”标签页。";
"Peek has no shortcut yet. Want one? Less Pull can suggest keys nobody uses." = "一瞥还没有快捷键。要一个吗？Less Pull 可以推荐没人用的键。";
"Set one up" = "设一个";
"Peek in color shortcut: click Suggest, or click the field and press your keys." = "“彩色一瞥”快捷键：点按“推荐”，或者点按输入框再按下你的键。";
"Suggest picks keys no macOS shortcut uses. One click, and they’re yours." = "“推荐”会挑 macOS 快捷键都没用的键。点一下，就归你了。";
"No problem. Peek waits under Settings → Shortcuts. Moving on." = "没问题。一瞥在“设置”→“快捷键”里等着。我们继续。";
"%@. Yours now. Let’s try it." = "%@。现在是你的了。试试看。";
"Whenever you like: Settings → Shortcuts. Moving on." = "什么时候都行：“设置”→“快捷键”。我们继续。";
"Sometimes you need color for a second. A chart, a photo, the red button." = "有时你只需要一秒钟的颜色。一张图表、一张照片、那个红色按钮。";
"Your turn: hold %@ together, and keep holding." = "轮到你了：同时按住 %@，别松开。";
"Clicking me doesn’t peek. Hold %@; I’ll wait." = "点按我可没法一瞥。按住 %@；我等你。";
"Hold, don’t tap: %@. Take your time." = "是按住，不是轻点：%@。慢慢来。";
"No hurry. Cursors wait for a living." = "不急。光标的职业就是等待。";
"There! Color, for exactly as long as you hold it." = "看！颜色回来了，你按住多久就有多久。";
"Now press %@ twice, quickly. The color stays." = "现在快速按两下 %@。颜色会留下。";
"Twice in a row, like a double-click." = "连续两下，像双击那样。";
"Kept! Press %@ once more and it’s quiet again." = "保持住了！再按一下 %@，就又安静了。";
"And quiet again. That’s Peek: color when you want it, gone when you let go." = "又安静了。这就是一瞥：想要时有颜色，松手就消失。";
"A session: a stretch of focused work with a gentle end." = "专注：一段专心工作的时间，结束得很温和。";
"Your turn: click the circle, then the first item, Session or break…" = "轮到你了：点按圆圈，然后选第一项“专注或休息…”。";
"The real panel. Session or Break: a break calls you back. Once." = "这是真正的面板。专注或休息：休息结束时会叫你回来。只叫一次。";
"Click a length: 25, say. On the tour it lasts just five seconds." = "点按一个时长：比如 25。导览中它只持续五秒。";
"Click a length, any of them. On the tour it lasts just five seconds." = "点按一个时长，哪个都行。导览中它只持续五秒。";
"The numbers in the panel: 25 will do. Or Not now, and we go on without it." = "面板里的数字：25 就行。或者点“暂不”，我们不做这一步，继续。";
"The numbers in the panel: any will do. Or Not now, and we go on without it." = "面板里的数字：哪个都行。或者点“暂不”，我们不做这一步，继续。";
"Started. Watch the circle in the menu bar: it shows the session. A few seconds, this one." = "开始了。看菜单栏里的圆圈：它显示着这段专注。这一段只有几秒。";
"There: the glow, the gong. 25 minutes in five seconds. Don’t tell the clock up there." = "看：光晕，锣声。25 分钟浓缩在五秒里。别告诉上面的时钟。";
"There: the glow, the gong. A whole session in five seconds. Don’t tell the clock up there." = "看：光晕，锣声。一整段专注浓缩在五秒里。别告诉上面的时钟。";
"There: the end. 25 minutes in five seconds. Don’t tell the clock up there." = "看：结束了。25 分钟浓缩在五秒里。别告诉上面的时钟。";
"There: the end. A whole session in five seconds. Don’t tell the clock up there." = "看：结束了。一整段专注浓缩在五秒里。别告诉上面的时钟。";
"That was a sample; it won’t be kept. A real one keeps counting past the end, gently." = "这只是一次试用，不会保留。真正的专注结束后还会继续轻轻地计时。";
"Not now, then. Sessions wait in the menu, first item. On we go." = "那就先不做。专注在菜单的第一项等着。我们继续。";
"A real one, running. It keeps counting while we go on." = "一段真正的专注，正在进行。我们继续时它会一直计时。";
"A break instead: it calls you back once, when it’s over. I’ll end this one for the tour." = "改成休息了：结束时它会叫你回来一次。为了导览，这一段我先结束掉。";
"It’s night by your schedule, so this is on already. A preview of the present." = "按你的时间表现在已经是夜里了，所以这已经开着。这是对当下的预览。";
"At night, a few points warmer. Like this." = "夜里暖几点。像这样。";
"That was Warmer at night. It comes by itself when your night begins." = "这就是“夜间更暖”。你的夜晚一开始，它就自己来了。";
"Warmer evenings on a schedule: want that? I’ll show you where it lives." = "按时间表让傍晚更暖：要吗？我带你去看它住在哪儿。";
"Night schedule, in General. Two choices: Sunset to sunrise, or Custom hours." = "夜间时段，在“通用”里。两个选项：日落到日出，或自定义时段。";
"Yours is Custom hours. Fine as it is; you can switch any time." = "你的是自定义时段。这样就好；随时可以切换。";
"Yours is Sunset to sunrise. Fine as it is; you can switch any time." = "你的是日落到日出。这样就好；随时可以切换。";
"Your hours: %@ to %@. Change them in the two fields, or keep them." = "你的时段：%@ 到 %@。在两个输入框里改，或者保留。";
"Warmer at night, just below: on for you. Try shows it for a moment." = "夜间更暖，就在下面：你的是开着的。“试试”会让你看一会儿。";
"Warmer at night, just below: off for you. +13 is a good start; Try shows it." = "夜间更暖，就在下面：你的是关着的。+13 是个不错的开始；“试试”会显示出来。";
"And Night Shift itself: Auto, On or Off, in the menu. Auto follows the same night." = "还有夜览本身：菜单里的“自动”“开”或“关”。“自动”跟随同一个夜晚。";
"Evenings: done." = "傍晚：搞定。";
"Fine by me. It waits under Settings → General, Night schedule." = "我没意见。它在“设置”→“通用”的“夜间时段”里等着。";
"No account, no tracking. Not even by me, and I came all this way." = "没有账户，没有追踪。连我也不追踪，尽管我大老远跑来。";
"A connected browser only passes on the address. Never the page." = "连接的浏览器只传地址。从不传页面。";
"Screenshots keep their colors. Quiet for you, normal for everyone else." = "截屏会保留原来的颜色。对你安静，对其他人一切照常。";
"Last offer: shall Less Pull open when you log in? Then the quiet is just there." = "最后一个提议：登录时就打开 Less Pull？这样安静就一直在那里。";
"Yes, at login" = "好，登录时打开";
"One catch: for that, Less Pull has to live in Applications. Move it there first." = "有个前提：要这样，Less Pull 必须放在“应用程序”里。先把它移过去。";
"General, near the bottom: Launch at login. Tick it." = "“通用”，靠近底部：“登录时打开”。勾上它。";
"The checkbox at the bottom of General: Launch at login." = "“通用”底部的复选框：“登录时打开”。";
"Done. From now on it’s there before you are." = "好了。从现在起，它总比你先到。";
"Sure. The checkbox waits under Settings → General, any time." = "当然。那个复选框随时在“设置”→“通用”里等你。";
"What you set up is ticked to stay. Tick or untick the rest; whatever isn’t ticked goes back." = "你设置过的已经勾上，会保留。其余的勾上或取消；没勾的都会恢复原样。";
"You changed one thing on the way. Tick it to keep it; otherwise it goes back." = "一路上你改了一样东西。勾上就保留；不然就恢复原样。";
"You changed a few things on the way. Tick what you keep; the rest goes back." = "一路上你改了几样东西。勾上要保留的；其余的恢复原样。";
"Kept, all of it. Your screen, your rules." = "全部保留。你的屏幕，你说了算。";
"Done: what you ticked stays, the rest is back." = "好了：勾上的保留，其余的已恢复。";
"Done. Everything as it was before I knocked." = "好了。一切都和我敲门之前一样。";
"Home now: lesspull.com, the little circle in the corner." = "现在回家：lesspull.com，角落里的那个小圆圈。";
"Come by sometime. There’s a drawn Mac to play with, and I’ll act surprised." = "有空来坐坐。那儿有一台画出来的 Mac 可以玩，我会装作很惊讶。";
"That’s the tour. Thank you for having me. Enjoy the quiet." = "导览到此结束。谢谢你的招待。享受这份安静吧。";
"Firefox opens its add-ons page. Click Add to Firefox, then Add. I’ll notice." = "Firefox 会打开附加组件页面。点按“添加到 Firefox”，再点按“添加”。装好了我会知道。";
"1. On the add-ons page that opened, click Add to Firefox, then Add.\n\nThe extension has no buttons: with a website in front, use “Exception for …” in the Less Pull menu. Keep Less Pull where it is installed." = "1. 在打开的附加组件页面点按“添加到 Firefox”，再点按“添加”。\n\n扩展没有按钮：网站在前台时，使用 Less Pull 菜单中的“… 的单独设置”。请把 Less Pull 留在安装位置。";
"Choose a browser. Less Pull connects to it and opens the page where you add the extension, with the steps to finish. Chrome, Brave, Edge and Opera get it from the Chrome Web Store, Firefox from Mozilla’s add-ons site, and Safari has it built in." = "选择一个浏览器。Less Pull 会连接它，并打开添加扩展的页面和收尾步骤。Chrome、Brave、Edge 和 Opera 从 Chrome 应用商店获取，Firefox 从 Mozilla 附加组件网站获取，Safari 内置。";
